WHY THIS WORKS
- stops qualifying someone who is already ready, per the rule against over-questioning
- still confirms scope and the paid nature, because those two cannot be skipped
- short messages, because hers are short
- arcs 1 and 3 say it is paid without naming a figure, because neither of them asked what it costs
- arc 2 gives the number in the message she asks it in, which is the only place it belongs

